<title>DUBAI: GOLF-DESERT CLASSIC SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DESERT CLASSIC SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following nine players</p>
<p>completed their first rounds in the Dubai Desert Classic golf</p>
<p>tournament early on Friday before the start of the second round:</p>
<p>69 - Daniel Chopra (Sweden)</p>
<p>70 - Gordon Brand jnr (Britain)</p>
<p>71 - Anders Forsbrand (Sweden), Massimo Florioli (Italy) Ian</p>
<p>Garbutt (Britain)</p>
<p>72 - Russell Claydon (Britain)</p>
<p>74 - Carl Mason (Britain)</p>
<p>75 - Robert Karlsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>77 - Steven Richardson (Britain)</p>
<p>Spain's Domingo Hospital and Britain's Colin Montogomerie</p>
<p>share the first round lead after shooting 65s on Thursday.</p>
</text>
